      "id": 124667,
      "name": "pwatson1974",
      "username": "pwatson1974",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-30T17:11:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Brief descriptions:</p><p>PW Argent Adept: Adept in the graps of some Shuma-Gorath style tentacled horrors with a central eye, his pipes held in one of his hands and the other glowing.</p><p>PW Captain Cosmic: Cosmic apparently transmuted to gold, a green-skinned woman is in the background with a white pony tail, armour and red lines crossing her cheeks.</p><p>PW Faantic: Fanatic being backed up against something while grey-skinned ghoulrs or vampires swarm around her, blood dripping from their mouths, bald with pointed ears. A shadowy cloaked figure is in the far background but no details.</p><p>PW Haka: Haka restrained with suitably high-tech and glowing metal bars, glowering down on a taunting Ambuscade.</p><p>PW Tempest: Tempest on the ground, a gene-bound maerynian (I think) crackling with red lightning standing over hir, a trident pressed into the ground around Tempest's throat, the tines on either side of hir neck.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bonus: K.N.Y.F.E. Rogue Agent: K.N.Y.F.E. i floating in a fluid-filled tank, eyes closed, breathing tube, wires and cables all over her, some of the equipment glowing yellow.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:58:44.323Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
